      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "warigwɛ jate",
      "rationale": "Wato sɔngɔ ye warigwɛ kɛmɛ wolonwula (600), so ye kɛmɛ ni ɲa fila ni tan (150) — sɔngɔ jatera."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "so",
      "rationale": "Heburukan ma kuma so fɔ yɔrɔ laban na (יוציאו janya kelen de don), nka kumasen in kɔrɔ b'a fɛ — so de bɛ bɔ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "בידם",
      "rationale": "'U bolo fɛ' — Heburu ka 'bolo' kalan ye kɛcogo ye (u nɔ na, u dɛmɛ ye), a tɛ bolo fiziki ye."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "shekel",
      "rationale": "Masinw bɛ 'shekel' fara 'warigwɛ' kan; Heburukan fɔ 'warigwɛ kɛmɛ wolonwula' dɔrɔn — jateden tɛ sɔrɔ sɛbɛnni kɔnɔ."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "U bilen, ka wato bɔ Mitsrayim (Misira) fɛ ni warigwɛ kɛmɛ wolonwula ye, ani so ni warigwɛ kɛmɛ ni ɲa fila ni tan ye; nin cogo la, u bɛ ⟨so⟩ bɔ Hitiw masakɛw bɛɛ la ani Aram (Siri) masakɛw la, u bolo fɛ.",
